     ],
     "quote": "It is complemented by our usage policies, which outline our expectations for how people should use the API and ChatGPT, as well as our safety protocols, which include testing, monitoring, and mitigating potential safety issues."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "L1-170_n006",
   "establishes": "The Model Spec is published to increase transparency and invite public discussion.",
